<main><section class="inner-hero"><div class="wrap"><nav class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Plan Your Trip</nav><span class="eyebrow">Custom Tanzania Itinerary</span><h1>Plan Your Trip</h1><p>Share the essentials first. We will use your dates, group size and interests to understand the trip you want.</p></div></section><section class="section wrap"><form id="planner" class="planner" action="/enquiry.php" method="post"><input type="text" name="_website" class="hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"><input type="hidden" name="trip" value="Custom Tanzania itinerary"><div class="planner-step active" data-step="1"><span class="eyebrow dark-text">Step 1 of 3</span><h2>Your Travel Window</h2><div class="contact-form"><label>Preferred arrival date<input type="date" name="arrival_date"></label><label>Preferred departure date<input type="date" name="departure_date"></label><label>Number of travelers<input type="number" min="1" name="travelers" value="2"></label></div><button type="button" class="btn gold next-step">Continue</button></div><div class="planner-step" data-step="2"><span class="eyebrow dark-text">Step 2 of 3</span><h2>What would you like to include?</h2><div class="choice-grid"><label><input type="checkbox" name="interests[]" value="Safari"> Tanzania Safari</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="interests[]" value="Kilimanjaro"> Kilimanjaro</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="interests[]" value="Trekking"> Other Trekking</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="interests[]" value="Zanzibar"> Zanzibar</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="interests[]" value="Culture / Day Trips"> Culture / Day Trips</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="interests[]" value="Chimpanzee Trekking"> Chimpanzee Trekking</label></div><div class="planner-actions"><button type="button" class="btn light prev-step">Back</button><button type="button" class="btn gold next-step">Continue</button></div></div><div class="planner-step" data-step="3"><span class="eyebrow dark-text">Step 3 of 3</span><h2>How should we contact you?</h2><div class="contact-form"><input name="name" placeholder="Your full name" required><input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email address" required><input name="phone" placeholder="Phone / WhatsApp"><textarea name="message" placeholder="Tell us about preferred comfort level, special interests, children, mobility considerations, or anything else that matters."></textarea></div><div class="planner-actions"><button type="button" class="btn light prev-step">Back</button><button class="btn dark">Request Custom Itinerary</button></div></div></form></section></main><script>document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',()=>{let s=1;const show=()=>document.querySelectorAll('.planner-step').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',+x.dataset.step===s));document.querySelectorAll('.next-step').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{if(s<3)s++;show()});document.querySelectorAll('.prev-step').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{if(s>1)s--;show()});});</script><?php require __DIR__.'/includes/footer.php';?>
